# Project Management Card
# Example Business Knowledge expressed in Menata Language
# Domain: Project Management — a task card, freely reordered within and across Lists
# Case 19 of the Case Portfolio (runtime/case-portfolio.md)
# References: pm-list.menata

Card

Fields

- List : List
- Title : Text
- Description : Rich Text
- Position : Number
- Assignee : User
- Due Date : Date
- Checklist : Table of (Item Text, Done)

Constraints

- List is required.
- Title is required.

Permissions

Member

- Move
- Edit

Views

- Card Form : Form
- List Cards : List
- Card Detail : Detail
